OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be dry with
OL,6,Fsunny periods. Cloud will increase for
OL,7,Fa time during the afternoon but
OL,8,Fconditions will stay dry and clear
OL,9,Fspells will return towards the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will start dry
OL,12,Fwith clear periods. Cloud and patchy
OL,13,Foutbreaks of light rain or drizzle
OL,14,Fspread east from late evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FCloudy with light rain and
OL,17,Fdrizzle at first. Outbreaks of
OL,18,Fpersistent and at times heavy rain
OL,19,Fwill spread east in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
